OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian MP Helen Haines remains in a
OL,8,Fcritical condition after being hit by a
OL,9,Fcar in what Prime Minister Anthony
OL,10,FAlbanese calls "a deliberate act"
OL,12,FThe suspect allegedly did a U-turn in
OL,13,Forder to strike the MP and then
OL,14,Freversed to ram her a second time, Home
OL,15,FAffairs Minister Tony Burke says
OL,17,FThe 65-year-old independent MP, who was
OL,18,Ftaken by helicopter to hospital in
OL,19,FMelbourne, has reportedly lost a leg
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
